# Frame dumps: SinkBlock writes .npz, and its webapp default lands INSIDE the tracked
# package dir. Both were reachable by a plain `git add -A` (report/ alone was 156 MB).
*.npz
webapp/_sink_output/

# Training/report artifacts: figures, metrics JSON, corpus statistics. CHANGELOG already
# stated these were untracked -- this is what actually makes that true.
report/

# Presentation assets (large, not part of the code deliverable)
slides/

# Internal working docs -- not part of the public release. The public docs
# (README, CHANGELOG, CONTRIBUTING, ROADMAP, tests/ and webapp/ READMEs) are tracked.
TODO.md
CLAUDE.md
# Internal dev tooling (swarm agent/skill definitions reference internal docs + local paths)
.claude/

# Private orchestration notes (its own git repo, never public)
notes/
